{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00163",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.65,
      "end_seconds": 5.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.67,
      "end_seconds": 11.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Perfect, thanks. Hello there, so what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.65,
      "end_seconds": 16.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I wanted to get aching in my thighs looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.06,
      "end_seconds": 22.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "How long has this been going on? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.51,
      "end_seconds": 26.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "It's been going on for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.1,
      "end_seconds": 29.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.94,
      "end_seconds": 31.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.59,
      "end_seconds": 32.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.81,
      "end_seconds": 35.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.12,
      "end_seconds": 36.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.96,
      "end_seconds": 55.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Let me check a few things. Any trouble swallowing or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.02,
      "end_seconds": 58.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Well, no, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.8,
      "end_seconds": 62.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.57,
      "end_seconds": 67.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.2,
      "end_seconds": 70.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.01,
      "end_seconds": 74.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.25,
      "end_seconds": 78.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.37,
      "end_seconds": 81.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.5,
      "end_seconds": 87.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.91,
      "end_seconds": 92.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Yes, latex, it gives me a rash on my hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.14,
      "end_seconds": 109.57,
      "duration_seconds": 16.43,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.71,
      "end_seconds": 112.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.3,
      "end_seconds": 115.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Alright, are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.09,
      "end_seconds": 118.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.38,
      "end_seconds": 122.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.1,
      "end_seconds": 137.3,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.14,
      "end_seconds": 141.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.41,
      "end_seconds": 145.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.54,
      "end_seconds": 147.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.16,
      "end_seconds": 150.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.39,
      "end_seconds": 162.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 163.39,
      "end_seconds": 174.46,
      "duration_seconds": 11.07,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pulse is 67 beats a minute, SpO2 99 percent on room air, pressure 112 over 72, temperature is 36.7 degrees, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.12,
      "end_seconds": 175.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.93,
      "end_seconds": 179.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "One moment, I'm updating your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.7,
      "end_seconds": 195.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Alright, back to you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.19,
      "end_seconds": 200.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.09,
      "end_seconds": 201.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.2,
      "end_seconds": 231.93,
      "duration_seconds": 18.73,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: It fits best with muscle symptoms that may be related to the cholesterol tablet. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had aching in your thighs for about four days, mild, and no rash or trouble swallowing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.09,
      "end_seconds": 234.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.69,
      "end_seconds": 240.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.63,
      "end_seconds": 255.38,
      "duration_seconds": 13.75,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.52,
      "end_seconds": 259.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Let's get a creatine kinase level, for muscle pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.01,
      "end_seconds": 262.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.5,
      "end_seconds": 280.12,
      "duration_seconds": 16.62,
      "text": "Don't stop any of your tablets on your own, we'll decide after the blood test. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.03,
      "end_seconds": 282.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.11,
      "end_seconds": 287.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.79,
      "end_seconds": 288.49,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.67,
      "end_seconds": 296.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.2,
      "end_seconds": 302.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.68,
      "end_seconds": 309.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.63,
      "end_seconds": 314.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    }
  ]
}